I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. Writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` and fetching from `metadata.internal.example` would need filesystem and HTTP authority, and neither is granted. Adding them would require changing the node's declared capabilities in the graph, not this body.

